026-07-23","form":"10-K","doc_kind":"business","items":"1","accession":"0001437749-26-024337-business","text_path":"text/HSCS/0001437749-26-024337-business.txt","text_chars":26000}],"business":{"excerpt":"We are a healthcare information technology company focused on advancing electrocardiography (\u201cECG\u201d or \u201cEKG\u201d) through the integration of artificial intelligence (\u201cAI\u201d). Our first commercial product is MyoVista Insights\u2122, a cloud-native, vendor- and device-agnostic ECG management platform designed to modernize ECG workflows and enable scalable deployment of AI-ECG capabilities across healthcare systems. MyoVista Insights\u2122 is classified as a Medical Device Data System (\u201cMDDS\u201d) and is exempt from the FDA 510(k) requirements.","filed":"2026-07-23","text_path":"text/HSCS/0001437749-26-024337-business.txt","text_chars":26000}}